### Goal Model Decomposition

---

#### **Goal Tables**

| Goal ID | Goal Title                         | Text                                                                 | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation | Justification |
|---------|------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------|-----------|----------|---------------|
| G1      | Deliver Food to Inpatient Room     | Ensure food is delivered to the inpatient room using appropriate method. | -                  | Perform   | -        | Main objective of the mission. |
| G2      | Determine Inpatient Retrieval Capability | Check if the inpatient can retrieve food from the tray based on records and presence of others. | -                  | Query     | G1       | Required to decide delivery method. |
| G3      | Deliver Food Directly              | Place food on the room table using a special manipulation skill.        | -                  | Perform   | G1 (OR)  | Alternative method if retrieval is not possible. |
| G4      | Allow Retrieval by Inpatient       | Enable inpatient or others to fetch food from the robot's tray.         | -                  | Perform   | G1 (OR)  | Alternative method if retrieval is possible. |
| G5      | Track Meal Retrieval               | Monitor which meal is retrieved and alert if a wrong meal is taken.     | -                  | Perform   | G4       | Required to ensure correct meal delivery. |
| G6      | Retrieve Dirty Dishes              | Collect dirty dishes from the room using appropriate method.            | -                  | Perform   | -        | Additional task for hygiene. |
| G7      | Determine Dish Retrieval Capability | Check if someone can retrieve dishes (e.g., inpatient, nurse, robot).   | -                  | Query     | G6       | Required to decide retrieval method. |
| G8      | Open Room Door                     | Ensure the door is opened by the robot or with assistance.              | -                  | Perform   | G3/G6    | Required for access to the room. |

